# The image only needs the gateway sources and the root helper. Everything
# else in this repository is the dsh monorepo: sending it as build context
# costs gigabytes for no benefit.
*
!Dockerfile
!gateway/
!gateway/**
!bin/
!bin/**
!skills/
!skills/**
# Browser plugins built from this repository (see build_image.sh, which stages
# them here before the build; gateway/plugins.mjs ships them into each profile).
!plugins/
!plugins/**
